+5. `npm install`
+   - Kind: install
+   - Expect: exits with code 0.
+6. `npm start`
+   - Kind: serve
+   - Expect: the app answers at http://127.0.0.1:3000/ (HTTP 200). Leave it running in its own terminal.
+7. `npm install`
+   - Kind: install
